OL,3,GNEWSAHeadlines: A royal visit and
OL,4,A'shin-kicking'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHere's our weekly round up of stories
OL,7,Ffrom across local websites in the West
OL,8,Fof England.
OL,10,FThe Prince of Wales was joined by a
OL,11,Fsurprise guest on a visit to Ilminster
OL,12,Fthis week, an event covered by the
OL,13,FSomerset County Gazette. He was
OL,14,Faccompanied by Celebrity Traitors star
OL,15,FRoss Kemp as Prince William launched a
OL,16,Fnew initiative to help communities
OL,17,Fprepare for emergencies and extreme
OL,18,Fweather events.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
