OL,3,GNEWSAHeadlines: A royal visit and
OL,4,A'shin-kicking'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBristol Live reported that the city
OL,7,Fcould get its first 'London-style' red
OL,8,Froute in a bid to stop dangerous
OL,9,Fparking.
OL,11,FThe Weston Mercury said flags have been
OL,12,Fput up along Weston-super-Mare seafront
OL,13,Fwithout permission again, despite calls
OL,14,Ffor those responsible to be arrested.
